// Microsoft Sentinel KQL — <ID> <title>
// Data model: docs/data-model.md
// Read-only. Schedule as an analytics rule.

OTHistorian_CL
| where TimeGenerated > ago(1h) and Quality_s == "Good"
| lookup kind=leftouter _GetWatchlist("OTBaseline") on $left.TagName_s == $right.TagName
// ... detection logic ...
| project TimeGenerated, TagName_s, Value_d, Mode_s
